Grammar

    0 $accept: programa $end

    1 programa: instruccion
    2         | programa ';' instruccion

    3 instruccion: create
    4            | read
    5            | update
    6            | delete

    7 create: CREATE ID '{' pares '}'

    8 read: READ ID
    9     | READ ID WHERE condicion

   10 update: UPDATE ID SET pares
   11       | UPDATE ID SET pares WHERE condicion

   12 delete: DELETE ID
   13       | DELETE ID WHERE condicion

   14 pares: par
   15      | pares ',' par

   16 par: ID ':' valor

   17 condicion: ID '=' valor

   18 valor: STRING
   19      | NUMBER


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    ',' (44) 15
    ':' (58) 16
    ';' (59) 2
    '=' (61) 17
    '{' (123) 7
    '}' (125) 7
    error (256)
    CREATE (258) 7
    READ (259) 8 9
    UPDATE (260) 10 11
    DELETE (261) 12 13
    WHERE (262) 9 11 13
    SET (263) 10 11
    ID (264) 7 8 9 10 11 12 13 16 17
    STRING (265) 18
    NUMBER (266) 19


Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

    $accept (18)
        on left: 0
    programa (19)
        on left: 1 2
        on right: 0 2
    instruccion (20)
        on left: 3 4 5 6
        on right: 1 2
    create (21)
        on left: 7
        on right: 3
    read (22)
        on left: 8 9
        on right: 4
    update (23)
        on left: 10 11
        on right: 5
    delete (24)
        on left: 12 13
        on right: 6
    pares (25)
        on left: 14 15
        on right: 7 10 11 15
    par (26)
        on left: 16
        on right: 14 15
    condicion (27)
        on left: 17
        on right: 9 11 13
    valor (28)
        on left: 18 19
        on right: 16 17


State 0

    0 $accept: • programa $end

    CREATE  shift, and go to state 1
    READ    shift, and go to state 2
    UPDATE  shift, and go to state 3
    DELETE  shift, and go to state 4

    programa     go to state 5
    instruccion  go to state 6
    create       go to state 7
    read         go to state 8
    update       go to state 9
    delete       go to state 10


State 1

    7 create: CREATE • ID '{' pares '}'

    ID  shift, and go to state 11


State 2

    8 read: READ • ID
    9     | READ • ID WHERE condicion

    ID  shift, and go to state 12


State 3

   10 update: UPDATE • ID SET pares
   11       | UPDATE • ID SET pares WHERE condicion

    ID  shift, and go to state 13


State 4

   12 delete: DELETE • ID
   13       | DELETE • ID WHERE condicion

    ID  shift, and go to state 14


State 5

    0 $accept: programa • $end
    2 programa: programa • ';' instruccion

    $end  shift, and go to state 15
    ';'   shift, and go to state 16


State 6

    1 programa: instruccion •

    $default  reduce using rule 1 (programa)


State 7

    3 instruccion: create •

    $default  reduce using rule 3 (instruccion)


State 8

    4 instruccion: read •

    $default  reduce using rule 4 (instruccion)


State 9

    5 instruccion: update •

    $default  reduce using rule 5 (instruccion)


State 10

    6 instruccion: delete •

    $default  reduce using rule 6 (instruccion)


State 11

    7 create: CREATE ID • '{' pares '}'

    '{'  shift, and go to state 17


State 12

    8 read: READ ID •
    9     | READ ID • WHERE condicion

    WHERE  shift, and go to state 18

    $default  reduce using rule 8 (read)


State 13

   10 update: UPDATE ID • SET pares
   11       | UPDATE ID • SET pares WHERE condicion

    SET  shift, and go to state 19


State 14

   12 delete: DELETE ID •
   13       | DELETE ID • WHERE condicion

    WHERE  shift, and go to state 20

    $default  reduce using rule 12 (delete)


State 15

    0 $accept: programa $end •

    $default  accept


State 16

    2 programa: programa ';' • instruccion

    CREATE  shift, and go to state 1
    READ    shift, and go to state 2
    UPDATE  shift, and go to state 3
    DELETE  shift, and go to state 4

    instruccion  go to state 21
    create       go to state 7
    read         go to state 8
    update       go to state 9
    delete       go to state 10


State 17

    7 create: CREATE ID '{' • pares '}'

    ID  shift, and go to state 22

    pares  go to state 23
    par    go to state 24


State 18

    9 read: READ ID WHERE • condicion

    ID  shift, and go to state 25

    condicion  go to state 26


State 19

   10 update: UPDATE ID SET • pares
   11       | UPDATE ID SET • pares WHERE condicion

    ID  shift, and go to state 22

    pares  go to state 27
    par    go to state 24


State 20

   13 delete: DELETE ID WHERE • condicion

    ID  shift, and go to state 25

    condicion  go to state 28


State 21

    2 programa: programa ';' instruccion •

    $default  reduce using rule 2 (programa)


State 22

   16 par: ID • ':' valor

    ':'  shift, and go to state 29


State 23

    7 create: CREATE ID '{' pares • '}'
   15 pares: pares • ',' par

    '}'  shift, and go to state 30
    ','  shift, and go to state 31


State 24

   14 pares: par •

    $default  reduce using rule 14 (pares)


State 25

   17 condicion: ID • '=' valor

    '='  shift, and go to state 32


State 26

    9 read: READ ID WHERE condicion •

    $default  reduce using rule 9 (read)


State 27

   10 update: UPDATE ID SET pares •
   11       | UPDATE ID SET pares • WHERE condicion
   15 pares: pares • ',' par

    WHERE  shift, and go to state 33
    ','    shift, and go to state 31

    $default  reduce using rule 10 (update)


State 28

   13 delete: DELETE ID WHERE condicion •

    $default  reduce using rule 13 (delete)


State 29

   16 par: ID ':' • valor

    STRING  shift, and go to state 34
    NUMBER  shift, and go to state 35

    valor  go to state 36


State 30

    7 create: CREATE ID '{' pares '}' •

    $default  reduce using rule 7 (create)


State 31

   15 pares: pares ',' • par

    ID  shift, and go to state 22

    par  go to state 37


State 32

   17 condicion: ID '=' • valor

    STRING  shift, and go to state 34
    NUMBER  shift, and go to state 35

    valor  go to state 38


State 33

   11 update: UPDATE ID SET pares WHERE • condicion

    ID  shift, and go to state 25

    condicion  go to state 39


State 34

   18 valor: STRING •

    $default  reduce using rule 18 (valor)


State 35

   19 valor: NUMBER •

    $default  reduce using rule 19 (valor)


State 36

   16 par: ID ':' valor •

    $default  reduce using rule 16 (par)


State 37

   15 pares: pares ',' par •

    $default  reduce using rule 15 (pares)


State 38

   17 condicion: ID '=' valor •

    $default  reduce using rule 17 (condicion)


State 39

   11 update: UPDATE ID SET pares WHERE condicion •

    $default  reduce using rule 11 (update)
